<title>CHINA: Trading in Chengdu Telecom suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Chengdu Telecom suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Chengdu Telecommunications Cable Co Ltd was suspended in late morning at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The shares rose HK$0.425 to HK$2.625 before the suspension. Volume was 4.0 million shares worth HK$10.47 million.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
